### HIGH-8: Error Messages Leak Internal Server Details to Clients

**File: [server/routes.ts](file:///Users/mac/Documents/Metallm-AI-Aggregator/server/routes.ts) (line 755)**
```typescript
fullContent = `Sorry, I encountered an error processing your request. Error: ${(e as Error).message}`;
```

**Also in multiple catch blocks where [(err as Error).message](file:///Users/mac/Documents/Metallm-AI-Aggregator/server/index.ts#79-82) is included in responses.**

**Impact:** Internal error messages can reveal:
- API key configuration issues
- Database connection details
- File paths and server internals
- Third-party service error details

**Recommendation:** Return generic error messages to clients. Log detailed errors server-side only.

